♪And shields me from all harm♪

05:29.590 --> 05:30.410
He got away.

05:38.910 --> 05:39.540
Da!

05:40.280 --> 05:41.260
Da! Er!

05:41.310 --> 05:41.820
San!

05:41.960 --> 05:43.540
Something is wrong with Wu!

05:43.560 --> 05:44.610
She isn't waking up!

05:44.680 --> 05:45.890
Wu!

05:45.920 --> 05:46.690
What is going on?

05:46.690 --> 05:47.450
What happened to Wu?

05:47.840 --> 05:49.060
She looks like she isn't going to make it.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.170
Master.

05:53.750 --> 05:54.610
Look at Wu.

06:01.920 --> 06:02.730
Wu.

06:05.680 --> 06:06.460
Master.

06:06.870 --> 06:07.410
What's wrong

06:07.720 --> 06:08.810
with Wu?

06:09.870 --> 06:11.050
She must have been tricked

06:11.600 --> 06:12.730
into eating something she shouldn't have.

06:13.390 --> 06:14.140
The pill I gave you

06:14.310 --> 06:15.220
can save her life,

06:15.830 --> 06:16.700
but I'm afraid

06:17.240 --> 06:18.220
her arm is a lost cause.

06:21.070 --> 06:21.610
Wu...

06:24.070 --> 06:24.850
Wu.

06:25.600 --> 06:26.050
Wu.

06:26.120 --> 06:26.700
Wu.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.580
Master.

06:34.830 --> 06:35.460
Wu's mistake

06:35.680 --> 06:36.730
was grave enough

06:37.390 --> 06:38.290
to warrant execution,

06:39.870 --> 06:41.140
but I'm grateful you chose

06:42.240 --> 06:43.140
to spare her.

06:43.360 --> 06:44.340
Thank you, Master.

06:46.270 --> 06:47.370
She has always been defiant,

06:47.920 --> 06:49.050
but I know all five of you

06:49.750 --> 06:50.580
mean no real harm.

07:02.070 --> 07:03.020
This is

07:03.680 --> 07:06.220
- the Foundation... - the Foundation...

07:06.560 --> 07:09.660
- the Foundation... - the Foundation...

07:09.870 --> 07:10.930
the Foundation Pill!

07:11.360 --> 07:12.170
Take it.

07:12.520 --> 07:13.580
You earned this.

07:14.140 --> 07:16.180
- This is... - The Foundation...

07:16.560 --> 07:17.250
This is for me.

07:23.750 --> 07:24.930
I thought

07:24.950 --> 07:27.020
I smelled something foul from a distance.

07:29.360 --> 07:30.730
Bullhead,

07:31.120 --> 07:33.580
who did this to you? You're in awful shape.

07:33.800 --> 07:34.900
This is urgent.

07:35.190 --> 07:36.900
I must report to Master immediately.

07:37.160 --> 07:37.930
Let me through.

07:45.870 --> 07:46.900
We got the Foundation Pill.

07:47.310 --> 07:48.170
It'll work this time.

07:48.630 --> 07:49.340
Keep your voice down.

07:50.430 --> 07:51.290
There is hope for us now.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.340
Stop talking.

08:12.190 --> 08:13.900
Master.

08:14.680 --> 08:16.540
Master.

08:17.680 --> 08:19.700
Master.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.540
Master.

08:24.510 --> 08:26.100
Master.

08:29.800 --> 08:30.580
The palace?

08:32.190 --> 08:33.580
The Master of the Black Fiend Cult is really hiding

08:34.040 --> 08:35.370
within the royal palace.

08:35.830 --> 08:36.410
Wu,

08:36.560 --> 08:37.810
open your eyes and look at me.

08:37.920 --> 08:39.020
Wu, are you all right?

08:40.480 --> 08:41.020
Wu.

08:49.270 --> 08:50.290
He took his own life.

08:51.870 --> 08:52.540
What is this?

08:56.190 --> 08:57.700
An introduction to the Mystic Yin Art.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.220
My respects to you, Master.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.020
I have failed in my mission.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.290
The outpost beyond the city walls,

09:18.720 --> 09:19.540
Protector Wang,

09:19.950 --> 09:20.780
and the Young Prince

09:21.430 --> 09:22.900
have all been captured by the enemy.

09:23.750 --> 09:25.340
I deserve whatever punishment you see fit.

09:27.950 --> 09:29.610
Do not fault yourself.

09:30.000 --> 09:32.660
Anyone who could wound you so grievously

09:33.430 --> 09:37.140
is no common foe.

09:40.070 --> 09:41.340
Those two must have acted

09:41.720 --> 09:44.700
with reckless pride

09:45.160 --> 09:46.610
and brought this fate

09:47.600 --> 09:50.290
upon themselves.

09:50.920 --> 09:52.050
Your wisdom is unmatched, Master.

09:52.510 --> 09:53.370
Our opponent's strength

09:53.720 --> 09:55.170
is formidable.

09:55.600 --> 09:57.140
Even when I used my demon transformation, my Beast Form,

09:57.510 --> 09:58.850
I still couldn't gain the upper hand.

09:59.800 --> 10:00.460
Master,

10:01.120 --> 10:02.140
from what I can tell,

10:02.390 --> 10:03.050
his cultivation

10:03.270 --> 10:05.290
is most likely at the Mid Foundation Stage.

10:06.160 --> 10:07.370
If we track him through those rogue cultivators

10:07.390 --> 10:09.010
and Protector Wang,

10:09.240 --> 10:10.730
we should be able to figure out where he's from.

10:11.030 --> 10:11.580
Then,

10:11.910 --> 10:12.820
we'll capture him

10:13.390 --> 10:14.770
and use his blood to aid your cultivation.

10:22.630 --> 10:25.340
I'll be ending my seclusion soon.

10:26.630 --> 10:27.850
If you stir up too much trouble now,

10:27.870 --> 10:30.250
you'll attract the attention

10:30.790 --> 10:32.980
of the Seven Great Sects

10:33.360 --> 10:34.850
and the Six Demonic Sects.

10:36.320 --> 10:38.060
Just be patient.

10:38.510 --> 10:40.250
When I emerge from seclusion,

10:42.200 --> 10:44.010
I'll have broken through to the next stage.

10:44.270 --> 10:45.300
By then,

10:45.750 --> 10:48.580
there's no one we'll need to fear.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.530
My congratulations to you, Master.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.650
Our lives and futures

10:54.790 --> 10:55.980
all rest on you.

10:56.320 --> 10:57.940
I will gather our forces

10:58.200 --> 10:59.130
and strengthen our defenses.

10:59.360 --> 11:00.250
We won't let him

11:00.510 --> 11:01.490
interfere you.

11:02.000 --> 11:03.460
All of you may leave now.

11:04.510 --> 11:05.610
I take my leave.

11:05.910 --> 11:06.980
Tie Luo,

11:07.750 --> 11:09.130
you stay.

11:10.030 --> 11:11.180
I shall tend

11:11.550 --> 11:13.100
to your injuries myself.

11:14.600 --> 11:15.580
Thank you, Master.

11:26.510 --> 11:27.370
Please help...

11:28.000 --> 11:28.580
Master.

11:28.720 --> 11:29.580
...bury him.

11:30.790 --> 11:31.980
Yes, Master.

11:34.270 --> 11:35.060
Master,

11:35.440 --> 11:36.580
these are the loot and gems

11:36.720 --> 11:38.460
we found on those cultists.

11:38.630 --> 11:39.980
We offer it all to you.

11:42.000 --> 11:42.940
You have been

11:43.320 --> 11:44.060
a great help this time,

11:44.360 --> 11:45.530
but what lies ahead will be

11:45.910 --> 11:46.980
far too dangerous for you.

11:48.550 --> 11:49.340
Consider this

11:49.790 --> 11:51.180
my parting gift.

11:51.440 --> 11:52.300
Parting gift?

11:52.720 --> 11:53.650
- But... - Master,

11:54.630 --> 11:55.700
did we do something wrong?

11:55.700 --> 11:56.700
Why are you leaving us?

11:57.600 --> 11:58.420
Truth be told,

11:58.670 --> 11:59.300
fighting alongside you

11:59.360 --> 12:00.980
and taking down the cultists

12:01.510 --> 12:02.700
over these past days

12:02.970 --> 12:04.300
has brought me more joy than I've known

12:04.480 --> 12:05.770
since I began cultivating.

12:06.150 --> 12:06.820
That's true.

12:07.200 --> 12:07.980
Master,

12:08.320 --> 12:09.130
please don't leave us.

12:09.360 --> 12:10.460
That's right, Master.

12:10.670 --> 12:12.340
The Five Mengs stand for loyalty.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.370
Are you really going to abandon us?

12:13.390 --> 12:14.490
Take me with you, won't you?

12:14.750 --> 12:15.370
Let me follow you...

12:15.390 --> 12:15.940
The Black Fiend Cult

12:16.440 --> 12:17.850
may have lost its wings,

12:18.270 --> 12:19.340
but its core remains untouched.

12:20.080 --> 12:21.300
All of you have been exposed.

12:21.750 --> 12:22.980
If you stay in the Imperial Capital any longer,

12:23.440 --> 12:24.370
you risk your lives.

12:24.960 --> 12:26.250
We're not afraid!

12:31.870 --> 12:32.730
My answer is still no.

12:34.030 --> 12:34.770
Go back.

12:39.360 --> 12:39.890
Master,

12:40.080 --> 12:41.340
from this day forward,

12:41.600 --> 12:42.980
the Five Mengs swear

12:43.000 --> 12:44.940
to become your disciples.

12:45.120 --> 12:45.940
We will follow you

12:46.120 --> 12:47.340
through the ends of the world without hesitation.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.980
Nonsense.

12:50.000 --> 12:50.700
All of you,

12:50.960 --> 12:52.010
be safe

12:52.720 --> 12:53.460
and live long lives.

12:55.000 --> 12:56.220
He's not taking us with him?

13:05.320 --> 13:06.130
He's gone.

13:13.240 --> 13:14.490
Take this Telepathy Talisman.

13:14.790 --> 13:15.490
If anything happens,

13:15.790 --> 13:16.370
send me a message through it.

13:19.910 --> 13:20.980
While I was in the Imperial Capital,

13:21.120 --> 13:23.580
I uncovered an organization practicing a deviant means of cultivation.

13:24.440 --> 13:25.130
They're known

13:25.510 --> 13:26.610
as the Black Fiend Cult.

13:27.440 --> 13:29.100
Their claws reach deep into every level of the capital.

13:29.550 --> 13:30.610
There's even a base hidden

13:30.870 --> 13:31.820
within Prince Xin's Mansion.

13:32.550 --> 13:33.220
I fear

13:33.390 --> 13:34.980
the royal palace itself may have been compromised.

13:35.910 --> 13:37.340
The front lines are already engulfed in chaos.

13:37.870 --> 13:39.130
If they incite unrest

13:39.320 --> 13:40.340
in the shadows now,

13:40.870 --> 13:41.730
the Yue Kingdom

13:41.870 --> 13:43.130
will never know peace.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.730
Until this cult is gone,

13:45.320 --> 13:46.490
I can't rest easy.

13:47.550 --> 13:49.060
I urge you to dispatch reinforcements swiftly

13:49.670 --> 13:50.770
to eliminate this threat, Master.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.010
Hongfu,

13:54.120 --> 13:54.890
listen to this.

13:55.320 --> 13:57.130
None of my disciples ever let me relax,

13:57.720 --> 13:58.890
especially that Han Li.

13:59.030 --> 13:59.820
He may seem composed

13:59.960 --> 14:00.850
most of the time,

14:01.150 --> 14:02.850
but when it matters most, he's the least reliable.

14:03.840 --> 14:04.890
I sent him to the Imperial Capital,

14:05.080 --> 14:05.650
and what does he do?

14:05.870 --> 14:07.940
Unearths a whole cult.

14:08.270 --> 14:09.250
What cult?

14:10.670 --> 14:12.460
Probably one that grew in the shadows while we were caught up

14:12.550 --> 14:13.460
in the chaos of war.

14:14.200 --> 14:16.220
The front lines are a disaster right now.

14:16.550 --> 14:18.340
Maybe it's better for the younger ones

14:18.790 --> 14:20.250
to stay far away from all this.

14:23.030 --> 14:23.420
True.

14:23.670 --> 14:24.530
You're right.

14:25.550 --> 14:26.820
I'll send Liu Jing,

14:27.030 --> 14:27.650
Wu Xuan,

14:27.870 --> 14:29.420
Song Meng, and Weiniang away for now

14:30.440 --> 14:31.610
to preserve our strength.

14:32.390 --> 14:32.890
All right.

14:33.240 --> 14:34.180
Let's go with that plan.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.340
That boy just won't let me have

14:36.600 --> 14:37.490
a moment of peace.

14:43.270 --> 14:44.490
After all this time cultivating,

14:44.790 --> 14:45.770
I still sneeze.

14:47.120 --> 14:48.650
I have a bad feeling about this.

14:49.870 --> 14:50.770
This won't do.

14:51.360 --> 14:53.010
I mustn't let myself be distracted anymore.

14:54.030 --> 14:54.700
I must cultivate.

14:55.030 --> 14:55.770
Cultivate.

14:56.030 --> 14:56.820
Cultivate.

15:07.120 --> 15:08.770
As of now, I've raised my main technique, Cyan Sword Technique,

15:09.080 --> 15:10.420
up to Tier 6.

15:11.440 --> 15:12.730
Once the Qin Residence situation is dealt with,

15:13.150 --> 15:14.460
I'll use the Green Vial's elixir

15:14.550 --> 15:15.530
to attempt a breakthrough

15:16.000 --> 15:17.730
into the Late Foundation Stage.

15:22.510 --> 15:23.340
Dissipation?

15:24.200 --> 15:25.730
Why are there signs of dissipation again?

15:35.360 --> 15:37.060
According to Triple Cycle Core Rebirth,

15:37.360 --> 15:39.460
once you reach Tier 6 in the Cyan Sword Technique,

15:40.000 --> 15:40.730
you must let your cultivation dissipate

15:40.910 --> 15:41.850
and rebuild it three times.

15:42.750 --> 15:44.530
With my fake spirit root,

15:44.870 --> 15:46.650
the only way I stand a real chance of breaking through to Core Formation

15:46.910 --> 15:49.100
is by compressing my cultivation core over and over.

15:50.600 --> 15:51.760
Still, repeated dissipation

15:52.550 --> 15:53.860
causes too much strain.

16:18.600 --> 16:19.890
And this manual doesn't appear

16:20.550 --> 16:21.820
to be complete.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.490
Demonic Transformation

16:26.750 --> 16:27.890
can boost one's power tremendously,

16:28.720 --> 16:30.700
but it comes with equally great risks.

16:33.200 --> 16:34.490
Those who practiced it

16:35.000 --> 16:36.650
eventually went insane.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.130
Perhaps it's the eerie blood aura

16:40.360 --> 16:42.100
that corrupts them.

16:52.870 --> 16:54.130
The Blood Condensing Five-Element Pill can be used

16:54.840 --> 16:56.220
to break through the Core Formation bottleneck.

16:57.080 --> 16:58.130
That explains things.

16:58.720 --> 16:59.700
The Master of the Black Fiend Cult

17:00.030 --> 17:01.460
must be cultivating this art.

17:03.120 --> 17:03.890
Still,

17:04.120 --> 17:05.340
if it means turning into something

17:05.550 --> 17:07.130
like Tie Luo, half-man and half-beast,

17:09.030 --> 17:09.650
then never mind.

17:16.360 --> 17:17.300
My tracks must have been exposed.

17:17.840 --> 17:18.730
They got here fast.

17:23.670 --> 17:24.730
Mr. Han!

17:38.670 --> 17:39.300
Mr. Han,

17:39.960 --> 17:41.770
you have visitors.

17:42.790 --> 17:43.650
Visitors?

17:53.960 --> 17:54.610
Mr. Han,

17:55.080 --> 17:56.010
do you know them?

17:56.320 --> 17:57.130
If not,

17:57.320 --> 17:58.730
I can send them running.

18:00.080 --> 18:00.490
All right.

18:05.910 --> 18:07.300
Jing, Meng, Xuan, Weiniang,

18:07.600 --> 18:07.980
please come in.

18:16.840 --> 18:17.580
Seniors,

18:17.840 --> 18:18.530
you've all traveled far

18:18.720 --> 18:19.420
to assist me.

18:19.670 --> 18:20.980
I'm grateful.

18:21.200 --> 18:21.850
Han,

18:21.960 --> 18:23.130
why the secrecy?

18:23.720 --> 18:25.220
You even told us in your message

18:25.360 --> 18:26.730
not to reveal that we're from Yellow Maple Valley.

18:27.600 --> 18:28.580
How's our disguise?

18:28.870 --> 18:29.890
Do we look like ordinary mortals?

18:30.360 --> 18:31.460
We rushed here.

18:31.630 --> 18:33.420
I'm glad we made it in time for the Lantern Festival.

18:34.870 --> 18:36.700
You've been in the Imperial Capital a while now.

18:37.200 --> 18:38.300
Have you visited Moxiang Abode?

18:46.880 --> 18:48.570
They say the peonies here are unmatched.

18:48.790 --> 18:49.810
Have you seen them for yourself?

18:50.750 --> 18:52.330
Are there any great martial artists in the capital?

18:52.720 --> 18:53.620
Any good food?

18:53.790 --> 18:54.700
Tell us everything!

18:56.350 --> 18:57.660
Han is here on Master's orders to eliminate evil

18:57.680 --> 18:58.660
and uphold the righteous path.

18:59.510 --> 19:01.140
It's best not to speak too casually

19:01.350 --> 19:02.700
about mortal affairs.

19:04.350 --> 19:05.250
Right, Han,

19:05.720 --> 19:07.090
about that cult you mentioned.

19:07.270 --> 19:08.220
What exactly is going on?

19:09.480 --> 19:10.570
Allow me to explain, Senior Liu.

19:11.830 --> 19:13.090
They're known as the Black Fiend Cult.

19:13.750 --> 19:14.980
They have been operating in the Imperial Capital for years,

19:15.270 --> 19:16.940
recruiting rogue cultivators from across the land.

19:17.440 --> 19:18.140
But in truth,

19:18.440 --> 19:19.380
they practice blood sacrifice,

19:19.790 --> 19:20.770
killing fellow cultivators

19:21.200 --> 19:22.050
to absorb their cultivation.

19:31.310 --> 19:32.220
Unforgivable!

19:32.830 --> 19:34.330
A cult that practices blood sacrifice

19:34.830 --> 19:35.860
must be eradicated.

19:36.880 --> 19:38.380
What is the Discipline Hall even doing?

19:38.790 --> 19:39.700
A matter this serious,

19:40.110 --> 19:41.050
and they know nothing?

19:41.790 --> 19:42.420
Han,

19:42.680 --> 19:43.490
do you have evidence

19:43.750 --> 19:44.770
for these accusations?

19:45.720 --> 19:46.900
Our sect's rules

19:47.030 --> 19:48.490
strictly forbid

19:48.830 --> 19:49.980
interfering in mortal kingdoms.

19:50.680 --> 19:51.700
The elders

19:51.830 --> 19:52.900
won't take it lightly

19:53.310 --> 19:54.250
if you act recklessly

19:54.920 --> 19:56.050
on mere assumptions.

19:56.750 --> 19:57.570
If you ask me,

19:58.070 --> 19:59.570
it's like hand doesn't know what the other is doing.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.940
The Seven Sects are too busy fighting the demonic sects

20:02.440 --> 20:03.770
to deal with anything else.

20:04.750 --> 20:05.660
And most of the victims

20:06.270 --> 20:07.700
are rogue cultivators,

20:08.400 --> 20:09.460
with no sect or backing.

20:09.880 --> 20:10.980
They're overlooked by the Seven Sects,

20:11.590 --> 20:12.700
so they have no power or reason to interfere.

20:14.200 --> 20:15.420
Based on the intelligence I've gathered,

20:16.160 --> 20:16.940
the Black Fiend Cult currently

20:17.510 --> 20:19.220
has four Foundation Establishment Stage Blood Guards,

20:19.920 --> 20:20.770
and a Master

20:20.960 --> 20:21.730
in seclusion.

20:23.160 --> 20:24.330
Right now, the few of us working together

20:24.640 --> 20:25.730
still stand a chance.

20:26.880 --> 20:28.490
But if that Master breaks through,

20:29.160 --> 20:30.220
the cult

20:31.000 --> 20:32.010
will become a real threat.

20:41.480 --> 20:44.220
- Amazing! - Wonderful!

20:46.070 --> 20:46.660
Another!

20:46.750 --> 20:47.490
Stop it.

20:47.720 --> 20:49.180
Did you forget what Li warned?

20:49.510 --> 20:50.940
There are still cult remnants free out there.

20:50.960 --> 20:52.460
You've got to be cautious with your spellcasting for now.

20:53.790 --> 20:55.660
Once someone learns spells,

20:55.830 --> 20:57.460
how can they ever go back to living a mortal life?

20:57.790 --> 20:58.900
It's just a trick.

20:59.030 --> 21:00.290
Don't worry, Caihuan.

21:00.750 --> 21:01.620
Li promised

21:01.680 --> 21:02.860
he'd protect us.

21:03.640 --> 21:04.460
- Impressive. - Indeed.

21:05.710 --> 21:06.490
[Ye She]
Daoist Qingwen,

21:06.960 --> 21:08.250
it has been confirmed.

21:08.590 --> 21:09.900
Half of those rogue cultivators were intercepted by these two.

21:10.720 --> 21:12.330
A child at the Qi Refining Stage

21:12.550 --> 21:13.330
and a mortal?

21:14.000 --> 21:14.700
Before the incident,

21:14.880 --> 21:16.730
they were spotted going in and out of the Qin Residence several times.

21:17.550 --> 21:19.050
Should we bring them in and interrogate them?

21:19.510 --> 21:20.140
No need.

21:20.720 --> 21:22.490
We have enough clues for now.

21:23.200 --> 21:24.140
If we move too soon,

21:24.440 --> 21:25.490
we might cause more trouble than it's worth.

21:26.240 --> 21:26.940
Head back.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.330
Say nothing about tonight

21:28.680 --> 21:29.570
to anyone.

21:30.110 --> 21:30.530
Understood.

21:33.880 --> 21:34.700
Qin Residence...

21:36.830 --> 21:37.460
Ye She,

21:37.590 --> 21:38.140
let's go.

21:39.590 --> 21:40.810
The lantern festival is lively.

21:41.000 --> 21:41.660
It's time

21:41.880 --> 21:42.940
we acted too.

21:45.830 --> 21:46.490
Everyone,

21:46.830 --> 21:47.810
stop hesitating.

21:48.350 --> 21:49.290
Han worked hard

21:49.310 --> 21:50.900
to uncover the cultists' secrets.

21:51.440 --> 21:52.250
Now is the time

21:52.830 --> 21:53.900
to act.

21:55.830 --> 21:56.700
Meng,

21:57.240 --> 21:58.730
aren't you always itching for a good fight?

22:00.270 --> 22:00.860
Fine.

22:01.680 --> 22:03.010
Since you've put it that way,

22:03.400 --> 22:05.010
count me in.

22:06.960 --> 22:07.660
If Jing's going,

22:08.000 --> 22:08.660
then so am I.

22:16.960 --> 22:18.290
Han, you brought us here.

22:19.110 --> 22:19.860
You must have a plan.

22:20.830 --> 22:21.660
Tell us

22:21.960 --> 22:22.530
about it.

22:33.640 --> 22:34.730
[Map of the Yue Kingdom Imperial Palace]
I left a tracking mark

22:35.070 --> 22:36.730
on one of the cultists.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.410
- The palace? - The palace?

22:40.480 --> 22:41.420
The Imperial Palace of Yue Kingdom.

22:42.000 --> 22:42.770
The Imperial Garden.

22:43.880 --> 22:44.770
The Imperial Library.

22:46.310 --> 22:47.140
The cult

22:47.590 --> 22:48.660
picked their location well.

22:50.000 --> 22:52.010
Cultivators are strictly forbidden from entering the palace.

22:52.350 --> 22:53.090
It's a firm rule.

22:53.920 --> 22:54.980
Should we storm in recklessly

22:55.200 --> 22:56.010
and falter,

22:56.480 --> 22:57.420
the consequences will be dire.

22:57.830 --> 22:59.220
That's exactly

23:00.110 --> 23:01.330
what they're counting on.

23:03.960 --> 23:04.770
I fear

23:05.200 --> 23:06.490
even the emperor

23:07.440 --> 23:08.700
may have become their puppet.

23:10.830 --> 23:12.980
They're using that rule

23:13.440 --> 23:14.660
to restrict our movements.

23:15.590 --> 23:17.530
But if we back down now,

23:18.510 --> 23:20.140
we're playing right into their hands.

23:22.000 --> 23:22.980
Sometimes,

23:23.310 --> 23:24.250
rules outweigh

23:24.590 --> 23:25.730
right and wrong.

23:27.200 --> 23:28.290
Rules are made by men.

23:28.310 --> 23:29.530
Right and wrong are set by the heavens.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.220
How can they be the same?

23:31.720 --> 23:32.570
If blame comes from above,

23:32.590 --> 23:33.770
I'll take full responsibility.

23:37.160 --> 23:38.220
The enemy is exposed.

23:38.350 --> 23:40.010
It's the perfect chance to strike their core!

23:40.310 --> 23:41.420
I agree with Senior Liu.

23:42.550 --> 23:43.250
So do I.

23:44.550 --> 23:45.940
Did you forget to mention that this cult

23:46.270 --> 23:47.330
was hiding inside the palace?

23:48.110 --> 23:49.010
Or were you simply unaware?

23:50.440 --> 23:51.250
Senior Wu,

23:52.000 --> 23:52.810
no matter

23:53.550 --> 23:55.140
where the cult tries to hide,

23:56.270 --> 23:57.380
we can't just stand by and do nothing.

24:00.310 --> 24:00.810
He's right.

24:01.030 --> 24:01.700
Xuan,

24:02.160 --> 24:03.090
are you coming with us or not?

24:03.590 --> 24:04.490
Just give us a straight answer.

24:04.920 --> 24:06.050
Yes, you should come with us.

24:11.480 --> 24:12.770
I'm afraid I must decline.

24:14.110 --> 24:15.290
I urge all of you to reconsider.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.460
Don't misjudge yourselves.

24:18.880 --> 24:19.570
Farewell.

24:20.920 --> 24:21.700
- Xuan! - Wu Xuan!

24:23.960 --> 24:24.860
Let him go.

24:25.510 --> 24:26.220
Those demonic sects

24:26.350 --> 24:27.140
are barely a threat.

24:27.920 --> 24:29.460
We don't need everyone to take them down.

24:30.310 --> 24:31.380
We can do this

24:31.830 --> 24:32.570
even without him.

24:34.000 --> 24:34.810
With you here,

24:35.720 --> 24:37.140
those demonic sects don't stand a chance.

24:42.550 --> 24:42.940
That's right.

24:43.590 --> 24:44.220
The three of us

24:44.680 --> 24:45.250
are more than enough.

24:46.790 --> 24:48.140
Still, better safe than sorry.

24:48.830 --> 24:49.570
We have to always assume

24:50.270 --> 24:51.330
the worst from our enemies.

24:51.960 --> 24:53.050
Han's right.

24:53.510 --> 24:54.900
Evil forces are nothing to fear,

24:55.480 --> 24:56.730
but those four Blood Guards are a different matter altogether.

24:57.480 --> 24:58.490
We mustn't underestimate them.

25:00.750 --> 25:02.460
But if we ask the sect for more reinforcements...

25:04.350 --> 25:05.090
I have an idea.

25:05.960 --> 25:07.330
There's someone who can help us.

25:07.790 --> 25:08.860
Look!

25:09.070 --> 25:10.460
- Look at all those lanterns! - They're beautiful!

25:10.480 --> 25:11.700
That fish lantern is exquisite.

25:12.200 --> 25:13.180
It's so lively here.

25:13.790 --> 25:16.010
- It's so beautiful here. - Han,

25:16.030 --> 25:17.380
you never told us

25:17.480 --> 25:18.660
the mortal markets were this lively.

25:19.310 --> 25:20.490
It's my first time

25:20.790 --> 25:21.660
at such a festive event too.

25:21.960 --> 25:22.530
Really?

25:24.030 --> 25:24.380
Weiniang,

25:24.480 --> 25:25.090
check this out!

25:27.400 --> 25:28.180
While the cultivation world

25:28.750 --> 25:30.330
is mired in turmoil, the mortal realm

25:31.000 --> 25:31.980
could still find moments of celebration.

25:33.160 --> 25:34.700
It probably won't last.

25:35.110 --> 25:36.770
Soon enough, blood and chaos will flood these streets again.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.250
I grew up

25:39.720 --> 25:40.770
in war as well.

25:41.790 --> 25:43.940
Troops from the north and south clashed endlessly.

25:45.350 --> 25:46.530
No matter who won,

25:47.240 --> 25:48.050
it was always

25:48.720 --> 25:49.730
the common people who paid the price.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.620
These cultists

25:52.880 --> 25:54.220
feed off that chaos.

25:54.830 --> 25:56.140
Just thinking about what they've done

25:56.160 --> 25:57.490
makes my blood boil.

25:58.110 --> 25:59.940
I want to tear them limb from limb.

26:01.590 --> 26:03.250
Did something happen to Senior Liu in the past?

26:04.200 --> 26:05.290
He gets so worked up

26:05.480 --> 26:06.490
every time a cult is mentioned.

26:08.440 --> 26:08.940
Hey,

26:09.070 --> 26:09.730
look who's here!

26:10.480 --> 26:11.770
I brought help.

26:11.830 --> 26:12.330
- Chen. - Senior Liu.

26:12.350 --> 26:13.330
- Chen. - Senior Song.

26:15.000 --> 26:15.730
Senior Chen.

26:16.200 --> 26:17.220
Han.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.140
You're always asking me

26:19.140 --> 26:20.050
about Han.

26:20.830 --> 26:21.900
Well, he's right here now.

26:28.440 --> 26:29.490
I already told Qiaoqian

26:29.680 --> 26:31.570
about the Black Fiend Cult.

26:32.030 --> 26:33.860
She happened to be around here on a clan mission

26:33.880 --> 26:35.090
in Nanwu City,

26:35.480 --> 26:36.090
and agreed right away

26:36.110 --> 26:37.530
to help us storm the palace.

26:38.790 --> 26:41.010
I've been receiving reports from the frontlines.

26:41.640 --> 26:43.810
The battle against the demonic sects is finally winding down,

26:44.350 --> 26:45.460
so I took the chance

26:45.680 --> 26:46.980
to visit the Imperial Capital and take a breather.

26:47.480 --> 26:48.900
If I can be of help to you,

26:49.030 --> 26:50.140
all the better.

26:53.140 --> 26:54.090
All right.

26:54.280 --> 26:54.950
You two catch up.

26:55.440 --> 26:56.980
Let's go check out the lanterns, Jing.

26:57.150 --> 26:58.010
- Come on! - I...

26:58.030 --> 26:59.090
Learn from us.

26:59.480 --> 27:00.090
Speak your mind.

27:00.270 --> 27:01.220
Never keep it bottled inside.

27:02.920 --> 27:03.490
Qiaoqian.

27:03.720 --> 27:05.120
- Let's go see the lanterns! - Go on.

27:05.120 --> 27:05.700
Slow down.

27:05.750 --> 27:06.730
Let's go! Wait for us!

27:06.750 --> 27:07.660
Let's go!

27:08.240 --> 27:08.660
Let's go see the lanterns!

27:08.720 --> 27:09.420
Senior Liu!

27:12.830 --> 27:13.660
Han.

27:14.160 --> 27:14.980
It's been a while.

27:21.030 --> 27:22.090
When I was young,

27:22.510 --> 27:24.420
my father kept me holed up at home cultivating.

27:24.830 --> 27:26.420
I missed out on so much of the world's splendor.

27:27.350 --> 27:28.380
Now, I find myself a little envious

27:28.640 --> 27:29.940
of those who get to experience it.

27:34.550 --> 27:35.220
Xiaomei.

27:36.110 --> 27:36.620
Father.

27:37.590 --> 27:38.090
Mother.

27:38.750 --> 27:39.730
Li Feiyu.

27:40.790 --> 27:41.700
I hope all of you are well.

27:42.240 --> 27:43.090
Han?

27:47.960 --> 27:49.050
There is nothing to envy.

27:50.270 --> 27:51.290
The cold of the mountains

27:51.590 --> 27:52.570
and the suffering of the world,

27:53.830 --> 27:55.330
immortals or mortals,

27:56.000 --> 27:57.220
all have their burdens.

27:58.680 --> 27:59.570
Do you think

27:59.880 --> 28:01.490
there is another world

28:02.030 --> 28:03.810
behind the reflection in the water?

28:05.350 --> 28:06.900
A place without cruelty

28:07.030 --> 28:08.090
or war,

28:09.110 --> 28:10.730
filled with freedom

28:11.310 --> 28:12.090
and purity.

28:12.790 --> 28:13.940
Like a dream.

28:14.880 --> 28:15.940
Illusions, like blossoms in a mirror and the moonlight on water.

28:16.270 --> 28:17.290
Beautiful, but fleeting.

28:19.640 --> 28:20.420
This world holds

28:21.000 --> 28:22.330
more sorrow than joy.

28:24.160 --> 28:25.570
Even on the path of cultivation,

28:27.750 --> 28:29.010
there is more hardship

28:29.590 --> 28:30.570
than ease.

28:32.200 --> 28:32.860
Senior,

28:34.200 --> 28:35.250
you should try to let go.

28:38.270 --> 28:39.860
You're unshackled by petty concerns.

28:40.750 --> 28:42.460
Talking to you for just a bit

28:42.680 --> 28:44.220
has helped me forget all my troubles.

28:45.030 --> 28:46.220
Have you had any dreams lately?

28:49.030 --> 28:50.250
Ever since I began cultivation,

28:50.960 --> 28:52.090
I rarely dream anymore.

28:54.440 --> 28:55.140
Is that so?

28:56.350 --> 28:57.660
I've been dreaming a lot lately.

28:58.000 --> 28:59.220
There is always a dark figure

28:59.720 --> 29:00.900
chasing me.

29:01.720 --> 29:02.900
No matter how I run, I can't escape.

29:05.270 --> 29:06.490
But every time,

29:06.880 --> 29:08.770
someone appears and protects me.

29:10.590 --> 29:12.420
Yet, I can never see their face clearly.

29:13.920 --> 29:15.290
Maybe what you saw

29:16.070 --> 29:17.380
was only a reflection in the water.

29:29.110 --> 29:29.860
Fireworks!

29:29.880 --> 29:30.700
Fireworks!

29:32.640 --> 29:33.570
They're so pretty!

29:34.000 --> 29:35.140
- Look, Jing! - Stunning!

29:35.350 --> 29:36.770
They're gorgeous!

29:37.310 --> 29:37.770
I see it!

29:37.790 --> 29:38.290
Jing,

29:38.590 --> 29:39.420
they're so beautiful!

29:39.440 --> 29:40.090
Look!

29:40.110 --> 29:40.730
Look, Jing!

29:41.160 --> 29:41.860
It's amazing!

29:41.880 --> 29:42.810
Look at that color!

29:45.000 --> 29:46.180
Look, Jing!

29:46.200 --> 29:47.290
This is amazing!

29:47.830 --> 29:48.700
Isn't it?

29:55.310 --> 29:57.010
Look, Jing!

29:57.110 --> 29:58.180
It's phenomenal.

29:58.200 --> 29:58.980
Look at that one!

30:01.440 --> 30:02.940
That one's so pretty!

30:03.240 --> 30:04.090
- Isn't it? - Look at that!

30:12.780 --> 30:14.620
♪The ripples disappear into the river♪

30:15.020 --> 30:18.140
♪My robe is soaked under the drizzle♪

30:18.980 --> 30:23.900
♪I drink alone as the moonlight melts with the liquor♪

30:24.860 --> 30:27.060
♪The current flows swiftly, the mountains weigh heavily♪

30:27.500 --> 30:29.780
♪The setting sun shines on the returning boats♪

30:30.780 --> 30:35.740
♪As I meander in the mortal world♪

30:38.980 --> 30:40.820
♪The breeze brushes through the corridor♪

30:41.220 --> 30:44.340
♪As the swallows whisper overhead♪

30:45.180 --> 30:50.100
♪The setting sun graces the bamboo forest, for whom do I harmonize?♪

30:50.740 --> 30:53.260
♪Leaning against the rails, water ripples below me♪

30:53.620 --> 30:55.980
♪The wind whispers to the forest♪

30:57.380 --> 31:01.940
♪I wander into the dream under the clear galaxy♪

31:05.460 --> 31:07.780
♪This journey that spans across the universe♪

31:08.260 --> 31:10.500
♪Feels both familiar and unfamiliar♪

31:11.380 --> 31:16.620
♪Looking at the various faces of our world♪

31:17.620 --> 31:19.700
♪Each word, each utterance♪

31:20.340 --> 31:22.420
♪Carries the hopes of a lifetime...♪

31:27.000 --> 31:28.180
Li,

31:29.750 --> 31:32.220
you belong with them, after all.

31:33.270 --> 31:34.810
Cultivators and mortals

31:35.400 --> 31:37.140
were never part of the same world.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.090
I can never

31:40.110 --> 31:42.140
stand by your side.

31:43.340 --> 31:45.540
♪And the gentle drizzle♪

31:46.660 --> 31:53.540
♪Some fates are never meant to intertwine♪

32:00.960 --> 32:01.700
Miss Mo,

32:02.720 --> 32:03.330
take care of yourself.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.420
How shameless!

32:24.830 --> 32:25.900
That Han

32:26.240 --> 32:27.180
is too much!

32:27.510 --> 32:28.670
Inviting all those relatives of his to stay at our residence

32:28.790 --> 32:29.620
for free.

32:30.160 --> 32:32.040
Does he think the Qin family runs a charity?

32:32.040 --> 32:33.490
Please, Young Master. Calm yourself.

32:33.940 --> 32:35.170
Mr. Han is new here.

32:35.170 --> 32:35.980
He hardly knows any propriety.

32:36.030 --> 32:36.930
Besides,

32:36.930 --> 32:38.290
the Master seems to favor him now.

32:38.320 --> 32:40.180
You're above all this.

32:40.310 --> 32:42.180
No need to stoop to his level.

32:42.270 --> 32:43.090
Fine.

32:43.200 --> 32:44.620
If I can't get at Han,

32:44.750 --> 32:46.250
I'll settle for his miserable relatives instead.

32:49.240 --> 32:50.180
Are you really going to go that far?

32:51.830 --> 32:53.090
Some people are just too eager

32:53.400 --> 32:55.050
to take the lead.

32:56.590 --> 32:57.620
If they lose,

32:58.350 --> 32:59.700
I'll personally report them

33:00.350 --> 33:01.330
to the Discipline Hall.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.140
Xuan'er,

33:10.720 --> 33:12.090
you think I'm right, don't you?

33:12.680 --> 33:14.420
I only want what's best for them,

33:14.790 --> 33:16.050
but they never listen.

33:19.590 --> 33:20.730
I miss you so much.

33:25.550 --> 33:26.420
You're one

33:26.790 --> 33:28.140
of Han's people, aren't you?

33:29.160 --> 33:30.090
Han?

33:31.480 --> 33:32.050
Men.

33:32.510 --> 33:33.810
Teach him a lesson.

33:47.960 --> 33:48.460
Monster!

33:48.880 --> 33:49.730
He's a monster!

33:50.310 --> 33:50.770
Run!

33:50.960 --> 33:51.530
Get out of here!

33:52.490 --> 33:53.110
Come on!

33:53.110 --> 33:53.730
Run!

33:53.920 --> 33:54.460
He's a monster!

33:55.960 --> 33:56.770
Xuan'er,

33:57.080 --> 33:58.420
I didn't scare you, did I?

34:00.110 --> 34:00.900
These people...

34:03.480 --> 34:04.010
Who's there?

34:21.200 --> 34:22.420
Such a bizarre cultivation technique...

34:27.680 --> 34:29.050
A new Foundation Establishment cultivator is around here.

34:30.030 --> 34:30.900
Unclear origins.

34:31.070 --> 34:32.050
Connected to the Qin residence.

34:32.440 --> 34:33.250
Looks like

34:33.550 --> 34:34.810
you're the one we've been searching for.

34:36.200 --> 34:36.770
You must

34:37.680 --> 34:38.570
be mistaken.

34:39.790 --> 34:40.940
That matters not.

34:41.510 --> 34:42.490
What matters is that our Master

34:42.510 --> 34:44.250
is breaking through right now.

34:45.400 --> 34:46.900
You're at Foundation Establishment Stage.

34:47.880 --> 34:48.460
We don't want to waste your cultivation.

34:48.510 --> 34:49.810
One against two, I don't stand a chance.

34:50.240 --> 34:51.570
I need to warn the others.

35:26.590 --> 35:28.180
How are you feeling?

35:29.510 --> 35:30.570
I am to blame.

35:31.270 --> 35:32.860
To think you had to tend to my wounds

35:33.550 --> 35:35.050
during your closed-door cultivation.

35:36.960 --> 35:38.900
You've served me for many years.

35:39.680 --> 35:42.140
Healing you

35:42.480 --> 35:43.940
is no trouble at all.

35:46.230 --> 35:47.420
But it seems

35:47.760 --> 35:49.090
someone has placed

35:49.710 --> 35:52.210
a tracking seal

35:52.800 --> 35:54.570
on you.

35:55.510 --> 35:56.570
Do you want me

35:56.840 --> 35:58.420
to remove it?

35:58.840 --> 35:59.740
No, Master.

36:00.400 --> 36:01.300
Leaving that mark

36:01.550 --> 36:02.210
might serve

36:02.710 --> 36:03.860
a greater purpose.

36:05.510 --> 36:07.380
What do you mean?

36:07.760 --> 36:08.460
If he traces it

36:08.960 --> 36:10.610
and finds his way here,

36:11.630 --> 36:13.340
we can turn the tables

36:13.760 --> 36:14.980
and trap him instead.

36:15.400 --> 36:16.780
Once I capture him,

36:17.150 --> 36:18.380
we'll sacrifice him

36:18.670 --> 36:19.340
to aid your cultivation.

36:22.960 --> 36:23.740
Very well.

36:24.480 --> 36:26.340
Let's do it your way.

36:27.440 --> 36:28.300
Master.

36:29.360 --> 36:30.530
I come bearing good news.

36:31.150 --> 36:32.820
I've acquired a valuable gift

36:32.920 --> 36:33.860
and wish to present it to you.

36:35.320 --> 36:37.300
Show me what it is.

36:43.000 --> 36:47.740
Indeed, the scent of a Foundation Establishment cultivator's blood.

36:48.000 --> 36:49.420
Leave me.

36:50.320 --> 36:52.050
I want to savor this

36:52.590 --> 36:54.570
in solitude.

37:31.070 --> 37:32.260
Seniors,

37:32.550 --> 37:33.940
do you remember this map?

37:35.550 --> 37:36.420
I've been

37:36.800 --> 37:37.820
watching this for days.

37:38.220 --> 37:38.920
[Map of the Yue Kingdom Imperial Palace]

37:38.920 --> 37:39.610
Even before

37:39.800 --> 37:40.900
you all arrived at the Imperial Capital,

37:41.230 --> 37:42.210
it never once

37:42.760 --> 37:43.460
moved an inch.

37:44.760 --> 37:45.740
You mean

37:45.840 --> 37:47.490
they knew they were being followed

37:48.630 --> 37:50.170
and set up an ambush there?

37:50.710 --> 37:51.260
That's right.

37:52.880 --> 37:53.980
Instead of walking into their trap,

37:54.630 --> 37:55.740
we'll use it against them.

38:02.110 --> 38:03.460
Then, we'll bypass this area

38:04.030 --> 38:04.780
and enter

38:05.030 --> 38:05.820
through the Royal Bedchambers and Cold Palace.

38:06.360 --> 38:07.380
Tonight, we split into two groups.

38:07.880 --> 38:09.130
Weiniang and Chen will head

38:09.760 --> 38:11.090
to the Royal Bedchambers to rescue Emperor Yue,

38:12.000 --> 38:12.860
while the rest of us

38:13.030 --> 38:14.460
seek the Master's hiding place

38:14.670 --> 38:15.900
before he leaves seclusion.

38:16.550 --> 38:17.340
We strike where they're forced to respond,

38:17.510 --> 38:18.380
then ambush their reinforcements.

38:18.880 --> 38:19.300
Precisely.

38:19.840 --> 38:20.650
That's the plan.

38:22.590 --> 38:23.420
In that case,

38:24.030 --> 38:25.010
everyone take a short rest.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.570
We move out at the hour of Zi tonight.

38:27.000 --> 38:28.260
Let us unite our strength

38:28.630 --> 38:29.490
and eradicate the cult.

38:30.280 --> 38:30.780
Understood.

38:32.840 --> 38:33.460
Someone's coming.

38:41.670 --> 38:42.380
Mr. Han.

38:55.710 --> 38:57.690
The kitchen has prepared some refreshments.

38:57.880 --> 38:59.490
Would any of you care for some?

39:00.550 --> 39:01.210
Great!

39:01.280 --> 39:02.300
We're starving.

39:02.320 --> 39:02.900
That won't be necessary.

39:03.250 --> 39:04.050
Please leave us.

39:08.480 --> 39:09.170
Is there anything else?

39:15.000 --> 39:15.570
Mr. Han.

39:16.100 --> 39:17.840
The Young Master seems to have lost his mind

39:17.840 --> 39:19.460
after he returned from the street.

39:19.630 --> 39:21.130
He's completely out of it.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.340
He won't stop muttering,

39:22.590 --> 39:23.530
"Spare me, Immortal."

39:23.710 --> 39:25.460
Madam fainted from worry.

39:25.480 --> 39:26.820
The physician says there's nothing more he can do.

39:26.960 --> 39:28.050
The Master has sent me

39:28.320 --> 39:29.490
to fetch you

39:29.630 --> 39:30.530
to examine them.

39:35.480 --> 39:36.340
I must tend to this.

39:36.880 --> 39:37.740
It won't delay our plans.

39:41.710 --> 39:42.980
This is far too risky.

39:43.920 --> 39:45.570
I just barely got off the frontlines,

39:45.840 --> 39:47.490
and now I have to fight for my life once more in the Imperial Capital.

39:49.710 --> 39:50.610
The two of you.

39:51.760 --> 39:52.610
I will report your contributions tonight

39:53.110 --> 39:54.490
to the Seven Sects.

39:55.190 --> 39:56.130
I promise your efforts

39:56.200 --> 39:57.210
won't be in vain.

39:58.400 --> 39:59.420
This mission will be grueling.

39:59.990 --> 40:00.610
Tonight,

40:01.030 --> 40:02.010
we will require your support.

40:05.440 --> 40:06.090
We won't

40:06.270 --> 40:07.280
let you down.

40:14.280 --> 40:15.400
- All done. - Oh, my son!

40:15.400 --> 40:16.610
You're finally awake!

40:16.720 --> 40:17.230
Master.

40:17.510 --> 40:18.690
Mr. Han brought him back like a miracle.

40:18.760 --> 40:19.460
He merely touched

40:19.550 --> 40:20.430
the Young Master lightly, and he woke.

40:20.430 --> 40:21.300
Madam is all better now too.

40:21.450 --> 40:22.420
Go on! Quickly!

40:24.370 --> 40:25.070
Master.

40:25.070 --> 40:25.610
Mr. Qin.

40:30.440 --> 40:31.690
I can never truly repay

40:31.730 --> 40:32.980
your kindness.

40:33.880 --> 40:34.970
Lord Qin, no need for such words.

40:35.360 --> 40:36.490
Still, allow me to say this.

40:37.400 --> 40:38.220
After tonight,

40:38.680 --> 40:39.660
things may change.

40:40.880 --> 40:42.090
You are a good man.

40:43.110 --> 40:44.090
It would be wise to make preparations.

40:48.590 --> 40:49.340
Change?

40:51.780 --> 40:53.320
[Bamboo Grove in Imperial Garden, Imperial Palace]

40:53.320 --> 40:54.450
In this entire palace,

40:55.070 --> 40:56.610
only this bamboo grove is well-hidden.

40:57.510 --> 40:58.450
We'll use this location

40:58.720 --> 40:59.930
as our fallback point.

41:01.280 --> 41:02.340
The Black Fiend Cult Master's cultivation is at least

41:02.680 --> 41:04.300
at the Late Foundation Stage.

41:04.800 --> 41:05.740
It's going to be a tough fight.

41:06.970 --> 41:07.890
This is the perfect opportunity

41:08.150 --> 41:10.270
to test the newly restored Five Phases Reversing Array.

41:11.240 --> 41:12.010
Sword auras,

41:12.320 --> 41:12.900
sword shields,

41:13.400 --> 41:14.050
talismans,

41:14.430 --> 41:15.970
artifacts, and talisman scripts are ready.

41:20.240 --> 41:21.130
I've got my trump card too.

41:21.550 --> 41:22.380
The only thing left

41:22.920 --> 41:24.010
is to give it everything I've got.

41:36.920 --> 41:37.650
Han.

41:49.480 --> 41:51.010
There's still some time before we move out.

41:51.760 --> 41:52.860
Can we have a moment alone to talk?

42:11.880 --> 42:12.610
Han.

42:14.960 --> 42:16.650
Before the Bloody Trial,

42:17.030 --> 42:18.090
you were the one who saved me

42:18.710 --> 42:19.740
in Yellow Maple Valley, right?

42:21.360 --> 42:22.690
No need to deny it.

42:23.550 --> 42:24.610
I know it wasn't a dream.

42:29.360 --> 42:29.980
I know

42:30.110 --> 42:31.010
it was you.

42:32.070 --> 42:32.980
And not just that one time.

42:34.110 --> 42:36.090
I feel like we've crossed paths many times since then.

42:36.800 --> 42:38.260
Every time I see you,

42:38.480 --> 42:39.900
I feel a little closer.

42:42.070 --> 42:43.380
But for some reason,

42:44.110 --> 42:45.380
I just can't remember clearly.

42:48.110 --> 42:49.650
Are the effects of the Oblivion Pill

42:49.960 --> 42:50.820
wearing off again?

42:52.400 --> 42:53.090
Forget it.

42:53.280 --> 42:54.530
If I can't remember, then I'll stop trying.

42:55.030 --> 42:56.170
I just wanted to tell you

42:56.920 --> 42:58.260
that the engagement between me and that Lu scoundrel

42:58.400 --> 42:59.940
was arranged by our families.

43:00.320 --> 43:01.690
I never had any feelings for him.

43:02.440 --> 43:03.010
Senior Chen,

43:03.360 --> 43:03.820
I...

43:04.030 --> 43:06.260
I don't even know why I'm telling you all this.

43:08.760 --> 43:09.530
But,

43:11.280 --> 43:13.010
there are just some things I wanted you to know.

43:15.150 --> 43:16.530
You don't think

43:17.960 --> 43:19.300
I'm a bad person, do you?

43:24.070 --> 43:24.610
No.

43:28.840 --> 43:29.380
All right.

43:30.320 --> 43:31.490
That's all I wanted to say.

43:32.280 --> 43:33.210
The operation will begin soon.

43:33.670 --> 43:34.780
Don't let yourself get distracted.

43:35.030 --> 43:35.940
Go make your preparations.

43:40.000 --> 43:40.490
Han,

43:40.760 --> 43:41.940
one more thing.

43:48.710 --> 43:50.050
Not far from Yellow Maple Valley

43:50.590 --> 43:51.860
is Baili Mountain,

43:52.510 --> 43:53.530
where wildflowers bloom in abundance.

43:53.670 --> 43:54.690
It's a beautiful sight.

43:55.880 --> 43:57.570
If we make it through tonight safe,

43:58.960 --> 44:00.420
would you go see the flowers with me?

44:03.190 --> 44:03.820
Senior,

44:04.110 --> 44:04.860
I don't think...

44:06.110 --> 44:07.260
So you want me

44:07.880 --> 44:10.010
to remember everything from before.

44:11.590 --> 44:12.210
Senior.

44:13.070 --> 44:14.530
With an invitation like that,

44:15.110 --> 44:15.860
how could I say no?

44:16.550 --> 44:17.460
I'll follow your arrangements.

44:55.670 --> 44:56.420
Let's go.

45:16.660 --> 45:21.980
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

45:23.220 --> 45:28.620
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

45:28.740 --> 45:31.940
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

45:32.180 --> 45:34.420
♪Old scenes rise again♪

45:34.820 --> 45:37.660
♪Too hard to forget♪

45:38.180 --> 45:42.140
♪Easier just to miss♪

45:42.980 --> 45:48.460
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

45:49.620 --> 45:54.900
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

45:55.500 --> 45:58.540
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

45:58.820 --> 46:00.940
♪Swept away by time♪

46:01.580 --> 46:04.220
♪Eyes once looked far♪

46:04.700 --> 46:08.660
♪Now lost in the shift♪

46:09.140 --> 46:11.980
♪Autumn winds stir♪

46:12.260 --> 46:14.180
♪Smoke curls once more♪

46:14.620 --> 46:17.060
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

46:17.380 --> 46:20.900
♪Returning to my eyes♪

46:21.460 --> 46:24.420
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

46:24.740 --> 46:27.660
♪Time lost its name♪

46:28.060 --> 46:30.900
♪Was it yesterday♪

46:31.300 --> 46:34.860
♪Or tomorrow?♪

46:35.220 --> 46:38.060
♪The world has changed♪

46:38.460 --> 46:40.300
♪Beyond recall♪

46:40.860 --> 46:42.580
♪Time will fade♪

46:42.980 --> 46:47.780
♪All the words ever spoken♪

46:48.460 --> 46:51.340
♪Only this longing remains♪

46:51.820 --> 46:57.100
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

46:58.220 --> 47:04.860
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

47:05.340 --> 47:15.060
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
